"A folder “1” appeared in “Avid MediaFiles/MXF” on this network drive. A system writes to it as if it were a local drive – probably someone is working without bin locking. Find out who and check their Media Composer settings." = "Ha aparecido una carpeta «1» en «Avid MediaFiles/MXF» en este disco de red. Un sistema escribe en él como en un disco local – probablemente alguien trabaja sin bloqueo de bins. Averigua quién y revisa su configuración de Media Composer.";
